## Non-open-source trademark assets

The project name, the project logo, and all trademark-related branding assets contained in this repository are **not** covered by the open source license applicable to the source code.

This includes, in particular, the following files (where present):

* `logo.png` (unmodified copy of `SA_dark.png`, used as the GitLab project avatar)
